Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Lets CatVision use its full shadow-boost strength.
; By default Windows refuses strong brightness curves. This raises that limit.
; It is the same tweak used by display calibration tools. Sign out or restart after.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion\ICM]
"GdiIcmGammaRange"=dword:00000100
